# INDEX: TESTING

## Required

1. `project-rules/rules/operational_rules.md`

## On trigger

- `architecture_rules.md`: the test requires restructuring or reveals coupling.
- `domain_rules.md`: the test covers contract/mapping.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: the test covers error flow.
- `auth_rules.md`: the test covers access/permission.
- `ui_rules.md`: the test covers presentation/interaction.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `domain_examples.md`: non-trivial scenario or fixture.
- Omit this section when there is no actionable reference.
